===Coalition balance and gender threshold===

The coalition distributes portfolios among the three constituent parties in accordance with parliamentary weight and policy specialization. The SCP holds nine portfolios, controlling the core state apparatus including the Premiership, Finance, Defence, Justice, Cabinet Secretariat, Internal Affairs, Economy, Environment, and Public Safety. The OSP directs six portfolios centered on social welfare, external diplomacy, transportation, public health, education, and rural agriculture. The SDP holds two strategic oversight posts in Gender Equality and Digital Sovereignty.

